WEBVTT

00:20:28.819 --> 00:20:31.957
And when you have these strong cultures

00:20:31.981 --> 00:20:34.771
with a bit of a lore about them,

00:20:34.795 --> 00:20:38.320
it becomes incredibly
difficult to trace back

00:20:38.344 --> 00:20:40.937
like, why certain things
are the way they are

00:20:40.961 --> 00:20:43.802
and the strong culture
just keeps them going.

00:20:43.826 --> 00:20:49.531
So I think that that's
absolutely a side effect,

00:20:49.555 --> 00:20:51.205
a potentially negative side effect

00:20:51.229 --> 00:20:52.602
of a really strong culture,

00:20:52.626 --> 00:20:54.459
especially as you scale.

00:20:54.483 --> 00:20:55.766
Those things might be fine

00:20:55.790 --> 00:20:59.097
if you stay at the same scale
for a very long time,

00:20:59.121 --> 00:21:04.184
but when every three to six months
the business is fundamentally different